uery filtered by values.work_order_id=WO-2025-09-004.\\\",\\n    \\\"period_and_work_order_record\\\": \\\"Task records source, work_orders and cost_periods; work order is assigned to PER-COST-2025-09 at SITE-US-WI-RACINE-DEKOVEN-1500 and that period has status PENDING_CLOSE with pending_close_timestamp 2025-09-30T18:00:00.\\\",\\n    \\\"oracle_policy\\\": \\\"Task records source precise policy excerpt, oracle_supply_chain_cost_management_26b.pdf, PDF page 233 (printed page 225), section Cost Accounting Period Statuses and Transaction Accounting. The excerpt says new transactions created after the pending close date, even if related to current or prior period, won't be processed; names revenue lines, COGS recognition, and manual cost adjustments as continuing exceptions.\\\",\\n    \\\"query_provenance\\\": \\\"Filtered query on r_27b0763014d53de50c997517 returned CE-250904-0004, source_transaction_id TXN-ISSUE-250930-1070, created_timestamp 2025-09-30T19:15:00, amount_cents 28476342, and accounting_status POSTED. Source content SHA-256: 48f4954e1a6f64b25b2a017104252db6df7706332845eb676ef94daf490d4ef2.\\\"\\n  }\\n}\\n\"}",
